## 🧠 System Architecture

```mermaid
graph TD
    USER["User"]
    UI["Streamlit UI (src/ui/app.py)"]
    STYLE["PMG Theme (src/ui/style.py)"]
    CLIENT["ApiClient (remote or in-process)"]
    API["FastAPI (src/backend/api/app.py)"]
    BOOT["BootstrapService"]
    ROUTER["AgentRouterService"]
    CHAT["ChatbotService"]
    RET["HybridRetriever"]
    LEX["Lexical TF-IDF"]
    SEM["Semantic (OpenAI embeddings or local fallback)"]
    GOV["GovernanceService"]
    SAFE["SafetyService"]
    TRANS["TranslationService (EN/FR + TTL cache)"]
    OBS["ObservabilityStore (SQLite)"]
    LOG["JsonEventLogger (JSONL)"]
    LIB["QuestionLibraryService"]
    LLMH["LlmHealthService"]

    USER --> UI
    UI --> STYLE
    UI --> CLIENT
    CLIENT --> API
    CLIENT -. fallback .-> ROUTER
    API --> BOOT
    BOOT --> ROUTER
    BOOT --> LIB
    ROUTER --> TRANS
    ROUTER --> SAFE
    ROUTER --> LLMH
    ROUTER --> CHAT
    CHAT --> RET
    RET --> LEX
    RET --> SEM
    ROUTER --> GOV
    ROUTER --> OBS
    ROUTER --> LOG
```

