## Metrics and SLA Monitoring

SLA endpoint:

```bash
curl "http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/metrics/sla" \
  -H "x-internal-token: dev-internal-token"
```

Tracked metrics include:

- `p50_latency_ms`
- `p95_latency_ms`
- `error_rate`
- `fallback_rate`
- `session_completion_rate`
- `total_sessions`
- `total_queries`

